\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  O come and mourn with me awhile;\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  O come ye to the Saviours's side;
\par  O come, together let us morn:
\par  Jesus, our Lord, is crucified!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Have we no tears to shed for Him,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  While soldiers scoff and Jews deride?
\par  Ah! Look how patiently He hangs:
\par  Jesus, our Lord, is crucified!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Seven times He spake, seven words of love;
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0   And all three hours His silence cried
\par  For mercy on the souls of men:
\par  Jesus, our Lord, is crucified!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  O break, O break, hard heart of mine!
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0   Thy weak self-love and guilty pride
\par   His Pilate and His Judas were:
\par   Jesus, our Lord, is crucified!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  A broken heart, a fount of tears,
\par \pard\li135\sl190\slmult0   Ask, and thy will not be denied;
\par   A broken heart love's cradle is:
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Jesus, our Lord, is crucified!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.   O love of God! O sin of man!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj  In this dread act your strength is tried.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj   And victory remains with love:
\par \pard       Jesus, our Lord, is crucified!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

